sort [sname asc, sk asc, rname asc]
└─ project (sk, sname, rk, rname) (rows≈4 cost≈5.7K)
   └─ join left [s.sk = r.rk] (rows≈4 cost≈5.5K)
      ├─ filter (call qdb_in_list |s.sk| 1 2 4) (rows≈4 cost≈768)
      │  └─ source s AS s row-groups (call qdb_in_list |s.sk| 1 2 4) (rows≈16 cost≈384)
      └─ filter (== |r.rq| 1) (rows≈3 cost≈384)
         └─ source r AS r row-groups (== |r.rq| 1) (rows≈6 cost≈192)
